    "news026":"• Bands are now selected with compact buttons in the top bar, including All bands.\n• Duplicate band text and the descriptive subtitle were removed from the map.\n• Observation window now uses direct 15, 30 and 60 minute buttons, eliminating the low-contrast dark-theme dropdown.\n• WSPR.live is added as an independent observational source and fused with PSK Reporter, RBN and NOAA without mixing observed and estimated evidence.\n• 11 m/CB now shows a solar/ionospheric estimate even without spots, clearly marked as not geographically confirmed.\n• The Assistant now interprets different question intents instead of always returning the highest chance.\n• Settings adds Factory reset, including local-data deletion.\n• Automatic update checking defaults to 15 minutes.",
